{"root":"mulia","ipa":"/ˈmulia/","core":"高贵的、崇高的、光荣的，通常指道德品质、地位或精神上的卓越。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","教会"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈmulia/","zh":"高贵的、崇高的","phrases":[{"t":"hati yang mulia","zh":"高尚的心灵"},{"t":"tujuan yang mulia","zh":"崇高的目标"},{"t":"tugas mulia","zh":"神圣的使命"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memiliki budi pekerti yang sangat mulia.","zh":"他拥有非常高尚的品德。"},{"t":"Pengorbanannya demi negara adalah tindakan yang mulia.","zh":"他为国家所做的牺牲是崇高的行为。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"mulia","ipa":"/ˈmulia/","zh":"高贵的","phrase":{"t":"orang mulia","zh":"高贵的人"},"example":{"t":"Sikapnya mencerminkan jiwa yang mulia.","zh":"他的态度反映了高尚的灵魂。"}},{"w":"memuliakan","ipa":"/məmuˈliakan/","zh":"尊崇、敬重、使...高贵","phrase":{"t":"memuliakan orang tua","zh":"孝敬父母"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus memuliakan nama Tuhan.","zh":"我们应当尊崇上帝的名。"}},{"w":"kemuliaan","ipa":"/kəmuˈliaan/","zh":"荣耀、尊贵","phrase":{"t":"kemuliaan Tuhan","zh":"上帝的荣耀"},"example":{"t":"Dia hidup demi kemuliaan keluarganya.","zh":"他为家族的荣耀而活。"}},{"w":"pemuliaan","ipa":"/pəmuˈliaan/","zh":"尊崇（行为）、赞美","phrase":{"t":"pemuliaan nama","zh":"名誉的尊崇"},"example":{"t":"Upacara itu diadakan sebagai bentuk pemuliaan terhadap pahlawan.","zh":"那场仪式是作为对英雄的一种尊崇形式而举办的。"}}],"derSlugs":["mulia","memuliakan","kemuliaan","pemuliaan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:51:05.928Z","src":"base"}